        "focus": ["responseApply", "toolCatalog", "policyHook", "toolSupervisor", "toolExecution", "receiptLedger", "contextWindow"],
        "note": "Tool 调用先过 catalog 与治理，再由 supervisor 统一处理 deadline、cancel、cleanup 和 durable receipt。"
